              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Domestic Policy and the \"Jamahiriya\" System</strong></p>\n\n<p>c1<br>\nEarly Years and Education</p>\n\n<p><strong>Dag Hammarskjöld was born on July 29, 1905, in Jönköping, Sweden. He studied at Uppsala University and the Stockholm School of Economics, showing early promise with his keen intellect and dedication to public service.</strong><br>\nSwedish Public Service</p>\n"
